    "description": "The data set contains information on the main meteorological and micro-climatic\nvariables of the Cape Shirreff area in Livingston Island. Three stations were\ninstalled in Daniel Beach, Paso Ancho and Toqui Hill. The measurements in the\nthree stations were made with automatic recorders (dataloggers) LICOR LI-1000,\nsensors of radiation and air and ground temperature (LICOR), relative humidity\nsensors (VAISALA) ,and analogical anemometers (WILH-LAMBRECHT).",
